  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 809.05 Exporter Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 809.05 Exporter Requirements. An exporter of spent lead-acid batteries destined for reclamation in a foreign country shall be subject to Env-Hw 400, Env-Hw 502, Env-Hw 504, and 40 CFR 262 Subpart H.\n\nSource. #12350, eff 8-14-17; ss by #12922, eff 11-23-19; ss by #14526, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
